# Project Overview

**Stack:** PHP 8.3 · Laravel 13 · Inertia.js 2 · Vue 3 (Composition API) · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS v4 · shadcn-vue (Reka UI primitives)

**Key characteristics:**
- Single-tenant, DB-configurable app (branding, locale, theme, auth via `app_settings` table)
- Auth: Laravel Fortify (email/password) + Zoho OAuth (Socialite)
- i18n: `vue-i18n` v11, JSON files under `lang/{locale}.json`
- Routing: Laravel Wayfinder generates typed route helpers at `resources/js/routes/`

---

## Absolute Rules

- **Never** hardcode the app name — always read from `settings('branding.app_name')` (PHP) or `useBranding().appName` (Vue)
- **Never** import Reka UI directly in pages or feature components — use the shadcn-vue wrappers in `@/components/ui/`
- **Never** use inline `style=""` for colors — use Tailwind utilities or CSS custom properties (`var(--primary)`, etc.)
- **No raw `<a>` tags for internal navigation** — use `<Link>` from `@inertiajs/vue3`
- **No `router.visit()` outside of forms** — prefer `<Link>` or `useForm().submit()`

---

## File Conventions

| Concern | Location |
|---------|----------|
| shadcn-vue primitives | `resources/js/components/ui/` |
| Shared business components | `resources/js/components/` |
| Page-level Vue files | `resources/js/pages/` |
| Composables | `resources/js/composables/` |
| TypeScript types | `resources/js/types/` |
| i18n translations | `lang/{locale}.json` |
| Controllers | `app/Http/Controllers/{Domain}/` |
| FormRequests | `app/Http/Requests/{Domain}/` |
| Services | `app/Services/` |
| Middleware | `app/Http/Middleware/` |

---

## Settings Pattern

```php
// PHP: read a setting
settings('branding.app_name', 'fallback');

// PHP: write a setting
app(AppSettingsService::class)->set('auth.zoho_enabled', true);
```

```ts
// Vue: read settings
const { appName, logoUrl } = useBranding();
const { currentLocale, supportedLocales } = useLocalization();
const { zohoEnabled } = useAuthSettings();
```
